    "EnviousWispr is in front, so there is nothing of yours to read. Select the word in the app you are writing in, then try again." : {
      "comment" : "Quick Add panel: why the selected text could not be read.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EnviousWispr ist im Vordergrund, dort gibt es nichts von dir zu lesen. Wähle das Wort in der App aus, in der du schreibst, und versuche es erneut."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EnviousWispr在前面，所以你没什么可读的。 在您正在写作的应用程序中选择单词，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "EnviousWispr is now in your Applications folder." : {
      "comment" : "Move to Applications result, the app was copied but did not reopen: the heading. EnviousWispr is the app name; keep it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EnviousWispr befindet sich jetzt in deinem Ordner „Programme“."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EnviousWispr现在在您的应用程序文件夹中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "EnviousWispr is open source, so you can check exactly what we send." : {
      "comment" : "Permissions settings, Privacy: line before the link to the data help article.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EnviousWispr ist Open Source, du kannst also genau prüfen, was wir senden."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EnviousWispr是开源的，因此您可以准确查看我们发送的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "EnviousWispr is running from a temporary location, so it cannot receive updates. EnviousWispr can fix this and reopen automatically." : {
      "comment" : "Move to Applications prompt: why the app should move. EnviousWispr is the app name; keep it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EnviousWispr läuft von einem temporären Speicherort und kann daher keine Updates empfangen. EnviousWispr kann das beheben und sich automatisch neu öffnen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EnviousWispr从临时位置运行，因此无法接收更新。 EnviousWispr可以解决这个问题并自动重新打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "EnviousWispr needs Accessibility permission to read your selection. Turn it on in System Settings, then try again." : {
      "comment" : "Quick Add panel: why the selected text could not be read.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EnviousWispr benötigt Zugriff auf die Bedienungshilfen, um deine Auswahl zu lesen. Aktiviere ihn in den Systemeinstellungen und versuche es erneut."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EnviousWispr需要辅助功能权限才能读取您的选择。 在“系统设置”中打开它，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "EnviousWispr needs Accessibility permission to type for you.\nYou can turn it on and come back, or skip ahead." : {
      "comment" : "Practice screen when Accessibility permission is off. Keep the line break.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EnviousWispr benötigt Zugriff auf Bedienungshilfen, um für dich Text einzugeben.\nDu kannst den Zugriff aktivieren und zurückkommen oder diesen Schritt überspringen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EnviousWispr需要辅助功能权限才能为您键入。\n\n你可以打开它再回来，也可以跳过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "EnviousWispr needs permission to use your microphone.\nYou can turn it on and come back, or skip ahead." : {
      "comment" : "Practice screen when microphone permission is off. Keep the line break.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EnviousWispr benötigt Zugriff auf dein Mikrofon.\nDu kannst den Zugriff aktivieren und zurückkommen oder diesen Schritt überspringen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EnviousWispr需要许可才能使用您的麦克风。\n\n你可以打开它再回来，也可以跳过。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "EnviousWispr never uploads your address book. These names are added to your word list on this Mac so dictation spells them right." : {
      "comment" : "Your Words, import from Contacts: the privacy note under the count.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EnviousWispr lädt dein Adressbuch nie hoch. Diese Namen werden deiner Wortliste auf diesem Mac hinzugefügt, damit das Diktat sie richtig schreibt."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "EnviousWispr从不上传您的地址簿。 这些名字被添加到这台 Mac 上的单词列表中，因此语音输入可以正确拼写它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "EnviousWispr only lists models Ollama already has. Use Browse models, or run ollama pull in Terminal." : {
