            "value" : "Ollama为这个模型返回了两个有效的名称。 将其添加到Ollama中，然后刷新此列表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ollama runs AI models on your Mac. No API keys, completely free. After installing, come back and click refresh." : {
      "comment" : "AI Polish, Ollama setup: what installing Ollama gets you.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ollama führt KI-Modelle auf deinem Mac aus. Keine API-Schlüssel, komplett kostenlos. Komm nach der Installation zurück und klicke auf Aktualisieren."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ollama在您的Mac上运行AI模型。 没有API密钥，完全免费。 安装后，返回并单击刷新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ollama runs open models you choose. Local polish runs on this Mac; hosted polish sends text to Ollama's servers." : {
      "comment" : "AI Polish, Why use Ollama: first paragraph.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ollama führt offene Modelle deiner Wahl aus. Lokales Polish läuft auf diesem Mac; gehostetes Polish sendet Text an Ollamas Server."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ollama运行您选择的开放式模型。 本地润色在这台Mac上运行；托管润色将文本发送到Ollama的服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ollama's servers" : {
      "comment" : "Transcribe a File, Review step: where the cleanup runs.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
