            "value" : "OpenAI API密钥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenAI polish sends your transcribed text, plus the active app name and any custom words you've added, but never audio. EnviousWispr also sends store: false so the provider is asked not to retain the request or response." : {
      "comment" : "AI Polish: what a cloud provider receives, shown under its API key field. Keep \"store: false\" as written; it is a request field.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Nachbearbeitung mit OpenAI sendet deinen transkribierten Text, den Namen der aktiven App und deine hinzugefügten eigenen Wörter, aber niemals Audio. EnviousWispr sendet außerdem store: false, um den Anbieter anzuweisen, Anfrage und Antwort nicht zu speichern."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OpenAI润色会发送您的转录文本，以及活动应用程序名称和您添加的任何自定义单词，但永远不会发送音频。 EnviousWispr还发送了store: false，因此要求提供商不要保留请求或回复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenAI rate limits by tier" : {
      "comment" : "AI Polish: link to OpenAI's rate limits page.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
