    "Say \"%@\" to insert a period." : {
      "comment" : "Speech engine settings, Start word row: an example. The placeholder is a spoken command in the dictation language, for example Diktiere Punkt; keep it exactly.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sag „%@“, um einen Punkt einzufügen."
